    "body": "The other thing we need to consider is what to return for `x/x;charset=\"\\\"\"`. I suspect we want `get()` that returns unquoted value (`\"`) and `rawGet()` or some such that returns the value as stored (`\"\\\"\"`). (See #40 for more details.)",
